    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play your formulas to reach objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/61816461c88db22442ead98924994714.poster.avif?t=1750178985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/61816461c88db22442ead98924994714.webm?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/61816461c88db22442ead98924994714.mp4?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your available formulas strategically to achieve various objectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/397bd9c16befa0d6dd571f2a6ce23f5b.poster.avif?t=1750178985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/397bd9c16befa0d6dd571f2a6ce23f5b.webm?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/397bd9c16befa0d6dd571f2a6ce23f5b.mp4?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your deck by incorporating new formulas or applying them to your own formulas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add unique effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/05e72e2a772e43b1b507e94471d15ea2.poster.avif?t=1750178985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/05e72e2a772e43b1b507e94471d15ea2.webm?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/05e72e2a772e43b1b507e94471d15ea2.mp4?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant your card with various unique effects to create outrageous and unique combos.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play your formulas to reach objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/61816461c88db22442ead98924994714.poster.avif?t=1750178985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/61816461c88db22442ead98924994714.webm?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/61816461c88db22442ead98924994714.mp4?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your available formulas strategically to achieve various objectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/397bd9c16befa0d6dd571f2a6ce23f5b.poster.avif?t=1750178985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/397bd9c16befa0d6dd571f2a6ce23f5b.webm?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/397bd9c16befa0d6dd571f2a6ce23f5b.mp4?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your deck by incorporating new formulas or applying them to your own formulas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add unique effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/05e72e2a772e43b1b507e94471d15ea2.poster.avif?t=1750178985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/05e72e2a772e43b1b507e94471d15ea2.webm?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278900/extras/05e72e2a772e43b1b507e94471d15ea2.mp4?t=1750178985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant your card with various unique effects to create outrageous and unique combos.</p>",
